cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ForenRAG, please cite the software using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "ForenRAG: An Event-Driven Retrieval-Augmented Framework for Provenance-Oriented Post-Alert Digital Forensic Investigation"
abstract: >-
  ForenRAG is a research prototype for automated post-alert digital forensic
  investigation. It correlates Wazuh alerts with Sysmon telemetry, creates
  structured evidence packages, retrieves local defensive knowledge, and uses
  a locally hosted language model to generate forensic reports. Version 0.1.2
  includes sanitised study data, matched RAG/no-RAG ablation results, and
  expanded reproducibility provenance.
authors:
